<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Claim Approved!</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { background: #22c55e; color: white; padding: 30px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; }
    .content { background: #f9fafb; padding: 30px; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px; }
    .button { display: inline-block; background: #22c55e; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; margin: 20px 0; }
    .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <h1>🎉 Claim Approved!</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="content">
    <p>Hi <%= @user.name || @user.email %>,</p>
    
    <p>Great news! Your claim for <strong><%= @stand.name %></strong> has been approved!</p>
    
    <p>You can now manage this stand on MyStandMap:</p>
    
    <p>
      <%= link_to "Go to Dashboard", farmer_dashboard_url, class: "button" %>
    </p>
    
    <p>You can update:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Stand hours and availability</li>
      <li>Products available</li>
      <li>Contact information</li>
      <li>Add photos</li>
    </ul>
    
    <p>Thank you for joining MyStandMap in connecting Wisconsin with local food!</p>
    
    <p>- The MyStandMap Team</p>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">
    <p>© <%= Date.current.year %> MyStandMap - Connecting Wisconsin with Local Food</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
